k used by the official Steam storefront. Bundled locally with colors and aspect ratio intact; only the XML declaration and external DTD header were removed. The Steam brand identifies Valve’s distribution platform, not authorship of any listed game.","language","en","获取方式","暂不可访问","access","section","源码","Platform listing is not game source — Complete source must be verified separately for each game; a Steam listing does not supply it.","service","演示",[84],{"_61":85,"_25":86,"_87":88},"浏览 Steam 游戏","https://store.steampowered.com/","note","Game storefront. Check each product's release status, supported systems, and acquisition requirements; this is not an embedded browser demo.","教程",[91],{"_61":92,"_25":93,"_87":94},"Steamworks 入门指南","https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/gettingstarted","Official publishing workflow covering partner setup, builds, store presence, and release review.","来源核查","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[105,106],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[110],"stages","构建与发布","主题",[114,115,116],"tags","游戏发布","游戏发现","桌面游戏","延伸阅读",[119,120],{"_61":85,"_25":86},{"_61":92,"_25":93},"项目源码",[123],{"_61":121,"_25":67},"用途与特点","Steam 是 Valve 的游戏商店；Steamworks 提供开发者入驻、商店展示、构建上传、测试与更新工具。发布前需要完成合作伙伴资料及商店页面、游戏构建审核。“即将推出”页面、试玩版与正式发行是不同状态。上架 Steam 不代表游戏由 AI 开发，也不代表完整源码公开。","detail","guidance","资源类型","社区","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[155,156],{"_145":146,"_147":148,"_32":149},[144],[142,143],"2d","3d","ship","tutorial",{"_61":154,"_25":93,"_17":145,"_87":94},"demo",{"_61":153,"_25":86,"_17":81,"_87":88},{"_61":150,"_17":151,"_87":152},"Platform listing is not game source","unavailable","Complete source must be verified separately for each game; a Steam listing does not supply it.","Browse games on Steam","Steamworks getting started",{"_61":153,"_25":86},{"_61":154,"_25":93},{"_158":159},"documents",{"_74":160,"_35":161},[163,167,168,169,166,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184